{"path":"memory/shared_ptr/swap","title":"std::shared_ptr<T>::swap","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::shared_ptr&lt;T&gt;::</span>swap","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/memory/shared_ptr/swap","section":"memory","kind":"page","summary":"Exchanges the stored pointer values and the ownerships of *this and r. Reference counts, if any, are not adjusted.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">void</span> swap<span class=\"br0\">(</span> shared_ptr<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> r <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Exchanges the stored pointer values and the ownerships of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">r</span></code>. Reference counts, if any, are not adjusted.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> r\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> smart pointer to exchange the contents with\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;memory&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;string&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw1\">struct</span> Foo\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    Foo<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span> _val<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy4\">:</span> val<span class=\"br0\">(</span>_val<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <s